Promoted Dart to GA maturity. Pattern matching for Dart now supports type inference for typed declarations (id_type propagation), boolean operator typing (`&&`/`||` as bool), alias-aware import equivalence (a pattern like `http.get(...)` matches code that imports `package:http/http.dart` under any local alias), method-chain ellipsis (`obj.foo(). ... .bar()`), multi-statement patterns (e.g. `$V = get(); ...; eval($V);`), and class-body ellipsis (`class $X { ... }`).
